Preamble
The Swiss Financial Market Supervisory Authority (FINMA),
based on Article 46 paragraph 5 of the Financial Institutions Act of 15 June 2018 (FinIA), Articles 11, 31 paragraph 3, 34 paragraph 4, 41 paragraph 9, 44 paragraph 3, 57 paragraph 8 of the Financial Institutions Ordinance of 6 November 2019 (FinIO) and on Article 5 paragraph 5 of the Financial Market Auditing Ordinance of 5 November 2014 (FINMA-PV),
ordains:
